WEBVTT

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:11.416
Marmalade Boy

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:14.442
But it's still on my mind

00:00:14.553 --> 00:00:16.521
This morning,
more so than before...

00:00:17.923 --> 00:00:21.154
A dream was interrupted

00:00:21.293 --> 00:00:24.785
I want to know how it ends for...
him and me

00:00:31.136 --> 00:00:36.438
Ah, God, please stop time

00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:40.036
Can't ﬁnd my books...
school uniform...

00:00:40.178 --> 00:00:43.011
My hair won't dry yet

00:00:44.349 --> 00:00:49.810
Ah, help me...my ribbon
doesn't seem to go on right

00:00:50.455 --> 00:00:56.587
All because I dreamt of him

00:00:57.496 --> 00:01:01.296
When I bit into my
half—burnt piece of toast...

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:08.837
All of a sudden
my heart started pounding

00:01:10.642 --> 00:01:15.545
Sweet and bitter marmalade

00:01:15.681 --> 00:01:18.115
That's why it's on my mind

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.675
Why am I feeling this way?

00:01:22.154 --> 00:01:23.917
Alll want is

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.882
to see his smile

00:02:04.596 --> 00:02:12.526
MAKING MEMORIES —
"NO MATTER WHAT HAPPENS,
I'LL HAVE NO REGRETS."

00:04:40.652 --> 00:04:43.621
SHIBUYA STATION

00:10:47.952 --> 00:10:49.681
MARMALADE BOY

00:10:56.694 --> 00:10:59.322
MARMALADE BOY

00:20:58.095 --> 00:21:01.622
DEPARTURES

00:22:11.335 --> 00:22:12.302
MARMALADE BOY

00:22:33.858 --> 00:22:36.850
NEW LIFE —
"YUU, HOW ARE YOU
DOING RIGHT NOW?"

00:22:49.106 --> 00:22:57.571
Until I can see you

00:22:57.715 --> 00:23:04.678
In the falling leaves

00:23:04.855 --> 00:23:13.058
I am trying to warm

00:23:13.764 --> 00:23:21.671
The half—cold cup of coffee

00:23:21.805 --> 00:23:24.535
I'm waiting for you, girl

00:23:24.675 --> 00:23:30.614
I feel like I have been
waiting for you

00:23:30.748 --> 00:23:37.210
Ever since I was born

00:23:37.354 --> 00:23:40.221
Just waiting for your love

00:23:40.357 --> 00:23:46.660
I want to be buried
in this feeling of love

00:23:46.764 --> 00:23:54.068
That grows stronger over time
